start: mr
R1: ch=hdc {hdc 2ch [2hdc 2ch]x3}@ring ss@top fo
R2: ss@corner ch=hdc {hdc 2ch 2hdc}@same [ch {2hdc 2ch 2hdc}@corner]x3 ch ss@top fo
R3: ss@corner ch=hdc {hdc 2ch 2hdc}@same [ch 2hdc@sp ch {2hdc 2ch 2hdc}@corner]x3 ch 2hdc@sp ch ss@top fo
R4: ss@corner ch=hdc {hdc 2ch 2hdc}@same [ch 2hdc@sp ch 2hdc@sp ch {2hdc 2ch 2hdc}@corner]x3 ch 2hdc@sp ch 2hdc@sp ch ss@top fo
R5: ss@corner ch=hdc {hdc 2ch 2hdc}@same [[ch 2hdc@sp]x3 ch {2hdc 2ch 2hdc}@corner]x3 [ch 2hdc@sp]x3 ch ss@top fo
